  "ruleText": "Bea 407.02 Other Information. Any information communicated to BEA that does not fit the categories listed within Bea 407.01 shall be subject to RSA 91-A. All information transmitted by BEA regarding the BMGI shall be subject to RSA 91-A.\n\nSource. #13515, INTERIM, eff 1-5-23, EXPIRES: 7-4-23; ss by #13734, eff 9-1-23",
